    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. What about the cost though? If i book a few weeks ahead, does the price difference between the bullet train and a low-cost carrier like Peach or Jetstar actually matter much for a business budget, or is the convenience of the train worth the extra yen?",
